+ * frame is kept (a ring of three), the frame between it and the one before is
+ * built and shown at once, and the new frame itself is shown half a frame
+ * interval later, from the FIFO loop's pump (rsx_vulkan_backend_pump_messages)
+ * -- everything on the one thread that owns the queue, the real frame shown
